      "prompt": "Simplify 4^(1/2) × 4^-2, giving your answer as a fraction where necessary.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "4^(1/2) is the square root of 4, which is 2, so 4^(1/2) = 2^1",
        "4^-2 = \\frac{1}{4²} = \\frac{1}{2⁴}",
        "4^(1/2) × 4^-2 = 2^1 × \\frac{1}{2⁴} = 2^(1-4) = 2^-3",
        "2^-3 = 1/8"
